        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10931297?u=600cfcb4c4e709dfbc66b328147d846ee87b1e51&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">I noticed some inaccuracies in the LCP render time page:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The top of the page states 0 will be returned for cross-origin requests but this is not the case now.</li>\n<li>Therefore you cannot use a non-zero render time as a measure whether the LCP is accurate.</li>\n<li>Reword the <code class=\"notranslate\">startTime</code> section as I found that difficult to understand.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I changed this in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2802557127\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37743\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/37743/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/37743\">#37743</a> but missed these.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Correct inaccuracies to avoid confusion</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Relates to: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2802557127\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37743\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/37743/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/37743\">#37743</a><br>\nRelates to: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3382978874\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/largest-contentful-paint/issues/138\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/largest-contentful-paint/pull/138/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/largest-contentful-paint/pull/138\">w3c/largest-contentful-paint#138</a></p>\n",
